# Cursor SDK configuration
#
# The Cursor harness uses LOCAL SDK agents with no setting_sources,
# meaning no user rules, skills, MCP servers, or hooks are loaded.
# Source is copied to a clean temp dir with .cursor/ stripped.
#
# Cloud agents are intentionally avoided: VEX-Bench strips .git history
# from snapshots to prevent leakage, but cloud agents clone from GitHub
# and would restore that history.
#
# Get your API key from: https://cursor.com/dashboard/integrations
CURSOR_API_KEY=your-cursor-api-key-here
